# WITHOUT THIS FILE, gcloud falls back to .gitignore -- which excludes data/*.duckdb,
# strips the database out of the source upload, and produces a container that starts
# cleanly and serves an EMPTY LEADERBOARD. (/healthz returns 503 on that, which is how it
# was caught, but the fix belongs here.)
#
# The DuckDB file is a build artifact for git and a REQUIRED INPUT for the image.
.git/
.gitignore
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

data/checkpoint/
tests/
docs/
